      "failure_scenario": "A sharp rise in credit costs due to a new NPA cycle (e.g., stress in MSME, agri, or infrastructure segments) compresses net interest margins, while slower credit offtake in a tightening macro environment stalls loan book growth, causing actual revenue to undershoot by 15-20%.",
