      "failure_scenario": "The RBI mandates higher provisioning buffers or introduces new capital adequacy norms, and a deterioration in the retail/SME loan book forces SBI to sharply increase provisions, compressing net profit growth to near-zero or even triggering a decline — a scenario not unlike FY2018-FY2019 stress cycles.",
